---
/**
 * The paper-grain overlay: 1px on 4px at 4.5% ink, fixed over the viewport.
 *
 * No will-change. It never animates, and promoting a full-viewport layer
 * permanently costs mobile memory. contain:strict keeps it out of layout.
 * z-index sits below the focus-ring stacking level so it can never wash one out.
 */
---
<div class="scan" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<style>
  .scan {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9;
    pointer-events: none;
    contain: strict;
    background-image: var(--scanlines);
  }
</style>
